<title>JAPAN: Key 182nd JGB yield falls to record low 2.200 pct.</title>
<headline>Key 182nd JGB yield falls to record low 2.200 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The yield of the benchmark three percent 182nd 10-year JGB fell to a record low of 2.200 percent in late afternoon Tokyo trading on Friday.</p>
<p>The JGBs rose on investors purchases and talk that the Ministry of Finance may postpone a regular 10-year JGB auction, usually set for later this month, to April, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8676</p>
